Sensei! I am always serious!

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.380
If you're undecided, then ask me for advice.

00:21:56.380 --> 00:21:58.080
Even if it's a vague idea,

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.880
do you have something you're interested in,

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:01.670
or something you want to become in the future?

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:02.960
Uh...

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.580
What's wrong?

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:06.580
Whatever it is, you can go ahead and say it.

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:09.920
Dragon...

00:22:10.670 --> 00:22:13.170
I want to ride on a dragon and go into battle...

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:18.750
So, is it like this?

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:22.540
Is my interpretation correct that you want to become
like a sort of entertaining martial artist?

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:23.540
That's not it!

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:26.710
I'm not a martial artist.
I use a bow... I'm an archer!

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:28.290
Are crazy. That's what you are.

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:31.960
I... I want to fight for someone else's sake...

00:22:32.250 --> 00:22:35.920
At some point, I will face two ultimate choices.

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:38.080
World peace...

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:40.830
Or the life of my loved one...

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:45.080
No, it's two choices between the sciences or
the humanities that you're faced with right now.

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:46.330
But!

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:48.880
Nevertheless, I have decided!

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:51.710
I will protect my loved one,
even if I make enemies out of everyone!

00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:56.130
But despite that... My loved one...

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:01.540
Realizes that and in exchange for world peace,
she ends up sacrificing herself...

00:23:01.540 --> 00:23:03.290
Princess!

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:07.170
She's that kinda person, you see. My loved one...

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:11.330
P-probably...

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:15.880
So, sciences or humanities. Which one will it be?

00:23:15.880 --> 00:23:19.000
Sensei. You're one of those people who don't get it...

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:21.330
I can't keep... This one...

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:24.420
Under my control any longer...!

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:28.380
Hu...rry! Run...!

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:31.790
While I'm... While I'm still me! Hurry!

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:35.750
Very well. Let's call your parents at once and talk.

00:23:35.750 --> 00:23:37.460
Oh, I'll choose humanities.

00:23:38.420 --> 00:23:40.290
She decided in two seconds...
